You can call these tools (parameters are JSON Schema; "required" lists the required arguments, and "default" is the value used when an optional argument is left out):

[
  {
    "name": "adjust_inventory",
    "description": "Record a relative change in stock for one SKU, with the reason, for the warehouse audit trail.",
    "parameters": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "sku": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Stock-keeping unit, exactly as written, including leading zeros."
        },
        "delta": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "Change in units: positive adds stock, negative removes it."
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string",
